/**
 * @defgroup MIDILAR_Devices Devices
 * @ingroup MIDILAR
 * @brief Devices that transform UMP packet streams.
 *
 * Every device has `Process(const Packet&)` and an `Output()` callback
 * (`Foundation::Functional::Callback`), so devices are chained without
 * virtual functions or allocation: `ChannelFilter`, `ChannelReassign`,
 * `Transpose`, `VelocityCurve`, `ScaleFilter` on `MCC::Scale`,
 * `ChordGenerator` on `MCC::ChordPattern`, a fan-out `Router`, and MIDI
 * clock with `ClockGenerator` and `ClockReceiver`, and a `StepSequencer`
 * with `EuclideanPattern()`, and MIDI Time Code with `MtcGenerator` and
 * `MtcReceiver`. Note
 * devices remember held notes (`HeldValues`) so they never leave notes
 * hanging.
 */

/**
 * @namespace MIDILAR::Devices
 * @ingroup MIDILAR_Devices
 * @brief Packet-stream devices.
 */
